---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Section library
description: Browse the Aceit Kit Starter sections, see their source files, and try the Fieldnotes example.
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="container container--narrow starter-library">
    <h1>Section library</h1>
    <p>
      Build a page from Nunjucks sections. Open Fieldnotes to see a hero, a list of features, and a
      call to action working together. Switch between Paper and Ink to see what changes when the
      same sections use different tokens.
    </p>
    <div class="starter-links">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ '/examples/fieldnotes/' | site_path }}">
        Open Fieldnotes
      </a>
      <a
        class="btn btn--outline"
        href="{{ '/assets/downloads/fieldnotes' | site_path }}"
        download="fieldnotes.html"
      >
        Download HTML
      </a>
    </div>
    <dl class="section-index">
      <div>
        <dt>Navigation and footer</dt>
        <dd>
          The chrome on this page comes from
          <code>sections/nav/nav-01.njk</code>
          and
          <code>sections/footer/footer-01.njk</code>
          . Edit labels and links in
          <code>src/_data/nav.json</code>
          .
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt><a href="{{ '/examples/fieldnotes/#intro' | site_path }}">Hero</a></dt>
        <dd>
          The starter uses
          <code>sections/hero/hero-01.njk</code>
          with defaults from
          <code>src/_data/sections.json</code>
          . Fieldnotes uses
          <code>hero-02.njk</code>
          with its own headline, links, and artwork.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt><a href="{{ '/examples/fieldnotes/#routes' | site_path }}">Features</a></dt>
        <dd>
          <code>sections/features/features-01.njk</code>
          turns the example’s
          <code>routes</code>
          data into a numbered list.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt><a href="{{ '/examples/fieldnotes/#pack' | site_path }}">Call to action</a></dt>
        <dd>
          <code>sections/cta/cta-01.njk</code>
          uses a title, description, and button from the page or the section defaults.
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
    <p>
      Section files live in
      <code>src/_includes/</code>
      . Edit the example’s content in
      <code>src/pages/examples/fieldnotes/index.njk</code>
      and its appearance in
      <code>src/assets/css/tokens.css</code>
      .
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
